    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d551">

                <pb facs="0775" n="765" sameAs="frus:frus1945v07/pg765"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/12–945</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Secretary of
                            State to the Director of the Office of Far Eastern Affairs</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Vincent</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-12-10">December 10, 1945</date>.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Vincent</hi>: The President has approved the
                    statements given to me.<anchor n="32" xml:id="d551-f1"/> I have told him to hold
                    them and unless he hears from me to the contrary to use them. If Marshall makes
                    any suggested changes such changes must be communicated to the President.</p>
                <p>The President also approved our memorandum to the War Department.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>J[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ames</hi>] F. B[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">yrnes</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
